  "notes": "NVIDIA writes the name with its company prefix (NVIDIA Nemotron Nano 2); the Nemotron 3 press release calls it Nemotron 2 Nano. Hybrid Mamba-Transformer design based on the Nemotron-H architecture (architecture reuse, not a model-to-model derivation, so no relation recorded). The 9B base and reasoning models were pruned and distilled from the 12B base model with the Minitron strategy. The Japanese variant NVIDIA-Nemotron-Nano-9B-v2-Japanese (Hugging Face repository created 2026-02-04) is out of scope; the alias Nemotron-Nano-9B-v2 may also appear in its news. Nemotron Nano V2 is kept candidate because NVIDIA also uses it inside the name Nemotron Nano V2 VL."
